<title>USA: Vans acquires stake in Internet magazine.</title>
<headline>Vans acquires stake in Internet magazine.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA FE SPRINGS, Calif. 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vans Inc, a maker of casual shoes and apparel, on Thursday said it acquired a minority stake in the Zone Network, publisher of the Mountain Zone, an Internet magazine dedicated to outdoor sports.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>&quot;This agreement will facilitate direct communication with our target 10- to 24-year-old customers, who are increasingly using the Internet as a primary source of information and entertainment,&quot; Vans Chairman Walter Schoenfeld said in a statement.</p>
</text>
